Small, inexpensive single-board computer from the [[Raspberry Pi Foundation|https://www.raspberrypi.com/]]. Runs [[GNU/Linux]]. The computer inside the [[Pi-Top]].

Used in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]].
